<title>USA: Penn State lab wins Navy sea environment study.</title>
<headline>Penn State lab wins Navy sea environment study.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Navy said Thursday it has awarded a $322 million contract to Applied Research Laboratory at Pennsylvania State University for research on environmental effects of torpedoes, undersea countermeasures and other devices.</p>
<p>It said the contract will require 3,420,900 staff hours of research at State College, Pa., and is to be completed by September 2001.</p>
